msgid "Build system maintenance contract"
msgstr "构建系统维护合同"

msgid ""
"Nexus uses one authored TOML assembly, a validated immutable configuration "
"IR, static instances and typed factory, and one CMake software target graph."
" Ninja executes the declared graph. Products own application sources and "
"composition."
msgstr ""
"Nexus 使用唯一作者 TOML 装配、验证的不可变配置 IR、静态实例／类型化 factory 和唯一 CMake 软件目标图。Ninja "
"执行声明图；产品持有应用源码及组合。"

msgid ""
"The {download}`48-item execution ledger <build-system-execution.csv>` "
"preserves the requested exit conditions. Implementation, executed software "
"verification, environment distribution and physical acceptance have distinct"
" evidence. Historical source qualification does not qualify changed build "
"tools."
msgstr ""
"{download}`48 项实施台账 <build-system-"
"execution.csv>`保留请求的退出条件。实现、已执行软件验证、环境分发及物理验收证据独立。历史源码资格不能为修改后的构建工具建立资格。"

msgid ""
"Configuration publication is a single-writer transaction. It protects every "
"authored and fact input before changing owned output. A rejected or "
"interrupted attempt cannot expose the previous configuration as current. "
"Successful identical generation preserves file content and timestamps so "
"ordinary reconfiguration does not force unrelated compilation. A "
"configuration digest is not a compiler or generator-source identity."
msgstr ""
"配置发布是单写入者事务，在修改所属输出前保护所有作者输入和事实输入。拒绝或中断不能把先前配置作为当前配置暴露。相同成功生成保留内容与时间戳，普通重配置不迫使无关编译。配置摘要不是编译器或生成器源码身份。"

msgid ""
"CMake owns source lists and target dependencies. The resolver emits selected"
" facts and its configuration-code dependencies, never a parallel software "
"build graph. ABI, optimization, diagnostics and firmware link policy have "
"explicit target boundaries. The firmware target guarantees its declared "
"delivery outputs and resource check. External application warnings are a "
"consumer policy."
msgstr ""
"CMake "
"持有源码列表与目标依赖。解析器只输出所选事实和配置代码依赖，不建立平行软件构建图。ABI、优化、诊断与固件链接策略有显式目标边界。固件目标保证声明交付输出及资源检查。外部应用"
" warning 属消费者策略。"

msgid ""
"Developer presets and native CMake/CTest remain the normal build interface. "
"Focused tests are development feedback. Commit gates and formal "
"qualifications execute their complete declared suites with fresh reports. "
"All runners preserve actual command exits, bounded concurrency, deadlines "
"and process cleanup."
msgstr ""
"开发 preset 与原生 CMake/CTest 保持常规构建接口。聚焦测试用于开发反馈；commit gate 与正式资格执行完整声明 "
"suite，生成 fresh 报告。全部 runner 保留真实 command exit、有界并发、deadline 和 process "
"cleanup。"

msgid ""
"Preparation may retrieve dependencies. Formal reproducibility uses two fresh"
" network-disabled builds with the same verified source SDK and recorded "
"environment and toolchain bytes. Compiler caches improve development only; "
"they cannot prove fresh-build reproducibility. Durable evidence stores "
"retain original records, member identities and failed attempts without "
"changing their historical status."
msgstr ""
"准备阶段可取得依赖。正式可复现性要求同一验证 source SDK、记录的环境和工具链字节进行两次全新禁网构建。Compiler cache "
"只改善开发，不能证明 fresh-build 可复现。持久证据保留原记录、member identity 和失败尝试，不改变历史状态。"

msgid ""
"Behavioral fixes use actual RED then GREEN execution. Python tools use "
"unittest; C/C++ contracts use the pinned GoogleTest/GoogleMock host "
"framework. CMake graph and policy defects require real small consumer builds"
" and artifact observations. Firmware stays C11 and contains no host test "
"runtime. Normal commit hooks and independent review apply to this "
"maintenance work."
msgstr ""
"行为修复使用实际 RED 后 GREEN。Python 工具用 unittest，C/C++ 合同用锁定 GoogleTest/GoogleMock "
"主机框架。CMake graph/policy 缺陷需真实小型 consumer build 与产物观察。固件保持 C11，无 host test "
"runtime。本维护遵循正常 commit hook 和独立审查。"

msgid ""
"The following support matrix records observed host tools and declared locks."
" The final clean-source software gates and eight exact offline candidates "
"are recorded in the [execution record](../delivery/build-system-"
"verification.md). Host observations retain their own scope; source "
"qualification uses the recorded code commit and never follows a later "
"documentation HEAD automatically."
msgstr ""
"下表记录观察到的 host tool 与声明 lock。最终 clean-source 软件门禁和八个精确 offline candidate "
"见[执行记录](../delivery/build-system-verification.md)。Host 观察保持自身 scope；source "
"qualification 使用记录的 code commit，不自动跟随后续 documentation HEAD。"

