msgid ""
"Ninja single-configuration builds are maintained. Ninja Multi-Config is "
"explicitly rejected; other generators have no implied acceptance. C11 "
"remains the firmware language. Native test targets enable C++17 without "
"linking that test runtime into firmware."
msgstr ""
"维护 Ninja single-configuration，明确拒绝 Ninja Multi-Config；其他 generator "
"无隐含验收。固件保持 C11。Native test target 启用 C++17，不把测试运行时链接进固件。"

msgid ""
"The Linux x86_64 CP312 offline tool closure contains 15 hash-locked wheels, "
"including the Setuptools build backend required by isolated local pre-commit"
" preparation. A fresh CP312 virtual environment completed an actual `--no-"
"index --require-hashes` installation and real isolated hook initialization. "
"The complete isolated tool domains retain their actual recorded source "
"scopes; the final ordinary commit gate separately executes the current "
"source. CP311 wheel bytes were checked against their 15-wheel lock; CP311 "
"installation was not executed. The minimum Python version and wheel "
"inventory do not substitute for that missing installation result."
msgstr ""
"Linux x86_64 CP312 offline tool closure 有 15 个 hash-locked wheel，包含本地隔离 pre-"
"commit 准备需要的 Setuptools build backend。全新 CP312 venv 实际完成 `--no-index "
"--require-hashes` 安装及真实 isolated hook 初始化。完整隔离工具域保持记录源码 scope；最终普通 commit "
"gate 另行执行当前源码。CP311 wheel 字节按 15-wheel lock 校验，但 CP311 安装未执行。最低 Python 版本和 "
"wheel 清单不能替代该缺失结果。"

msgid ""
"The recorded OCI artifact uses Python 3.12.15 and Git 2.47.3, distinct from "
"the current host versions. Its manifest is "
"`e936b188b9e30cf37ce109a5407019c91fe2dbc62fb10afceb3f2abbfc823ac8` and its "
"image config is "
"`a1ba03c16d424aef88dad6e5b2ead2892734a0bf909dedc23d8855fa4861fbe0`. The "
"actual ARM toolchain tree contains 7,190 files and 1,106,755,364 bytes with "
"tree SHA-256 "
"`44d2fe14e401730074302ad87bdef9762a6cfe12de4bebc6853d181fd51c74fd`. "
"Toolchain and OCI transport executions retain their own tool-source "
"identities; their results do not transfer source qualification to later tool"
" changes."
msgstr ""
"记录 OCI 产物使用 Python 3.12.15、Git 2.47.3，与当前 host 不同。Manifest 为 "
"`e936b188b9e30cf37ce109a5407019c91fe2dbc62fb10afceb3f2abbfc823ac8`，image "
"config 为 "
"`a1ba03c16d424aef88dad6e5b2ead2892734a0bf909dedc23d8855fa4861fbe0`。真实 ARM "
"toolchain tree 有 7,190 文件、1,106,755,364 字节，tree SHA-256 "
"`44d2fe14e401730074302ad87bdef9762a6cfe12de4bebc6853d181fd51c74fd`。Toolchain／OCI"
" transport 执行保留自身 tool-source 身份，结果不能转移为后续 tool 变更的 source qualification。"

msgid ""
"Fixed base/frontend digests, Debian snapshot selection, five APT package "
"versions and hash-required Python inputs are declared in the recipe lock. "
"Reconstruction of the observed OCI bytes has not executed successfully: "
"`recipe_reproducible` remains `false`. Verified artifact reuse and declared "
"recipe inputs therefore remain separate acceptance states."
msgstr ""
"Recipe lock 声明固定 base/frontend digest、Debian snapshot、五个 APT package 版本及 "
"hash-required Python 输入。已观察 OCI 字节重建尚未成功执行，`recipe_reproducible` 保持 "
"`false`。验证产物复用与声明 recipe 输入是独立验收状态。"

msgid ""
"The execution ledger keeps all 48 requested requirements and exit conditions"
" unchanged. Its updated paths bind the implementation, original RED/GREEN "
"records and the final-source software gates in the [execution "
"record](../delivery/build-system-verification.md) and {download}`result "
"index <../delivery/build-system-results.json>`. Historical measurements "
"retain their source and exact selections instead of inheriting a later HEAD."
msgstr ""
"实施台账保持全部 48 原要求与退出条件不变。更新路径把实现、原 RED/GREEN "
"和最终源码软件门禁绑定至[执行记录](../delivery/build-system-verification.md)与 "
"{download}`结果索引 <../delivery/build-system-"
"results.json>`。历史测量保留自身源码与精确选择，不继承后续 HEAD。"

msgid ""
"Automatic developer provenance binds a unique immutable command-attempt "
"receipt and checks its command and working directory. Complete current "
"contracts and actual candidate plan execution establish this association; a "
"shared latest report name cannot substitute for an exact attempt."
msgstr ""
"自动开发 provenance 绑定唯一不可变 command-attempt receipt 并核对命令与工作目录。完整当前合同与真实 "
"candidate plan 执行建立该关联；共享 latest 报告名不能替代精确 attempt。"

msgid ""
"BLD-18 retains full SDK byte checks at each consumption boundary after "
"measurement, with no parent marker or persistent verification bypass. BLD-31"
" retains common static libraries after measuring declared versus actually "
"compiled units and exact selected-image costs. Their `decision_verified` "
"states record measured choices rather than speculative source splitting."
msgstr ""
"BLD-18 测量后保留每次消费边界完整 SDK 字节检查，无 parent marker 或 persistent verification "
"bypass。BLD-31 测量声明／实际编译单元和精确选定镜像成本后保留公共静态库。其 `decision_verified` "
"状态记录测量选择，而非推测性 source split。"

msgid ""
"BLD-38 records actual fixed-checker candidate plans and genuine failed-"
"checker execution. The original orchestration exit condition remains "
"unchanged. The maintained 72-stage software plan did not run through one "
"complete plan invocation; individually executed full gates are recorded "
"separately. BLD-39 validates dependency-upgrade evidence contracts, without "
"claiming an actual vendor dependency upgrade."
msgstr ""
"BLD-38 记录实际 fixed-checker candidate plan 与真实 failed-checker 执行，原编排退出条件不变。维护的"
" 72-stage 软件 plan 未经单次完整 plan invocation 执行；分别执行的 full gate 另记。BLD-39 验证 "
"dependency-upgrade evidence 合同，不声称真实 vendor dependency 升级。"

msgid ""
"BLD-40 covers actual CP312 offline installation and isolated hook "
"preparation; CP311 installation remains unexecuted. BLD-41 covers actual "
"whole-toolchain and OCI transport and verified reuse of the same bytes. "
"BLD-42 remains `declared_recipe_verified_reconstruction_unverified`, with "
"`recipe_reproducible=false`. BLD-44 covers actual new-source archived proof "
"and independent archive-only verification. Local archive retention and a "
"durable hard-link name do not establish off-site storage, publication or a "
"release."
msgstr ""
"BLD-40 覆盖真实 CP312 offline 安装与 isolated hook 准备，CP311 安装未执行。BLD-41 覆盖真实完整 "
"toolchain／OCI transport 与同字节验证复用。BLD-42 保持 "
"`declared_recipe_verified_reconstruction_unverified` 且 "
"`recipe_reproducible=false`。BLD-44 覆盖真实新源码 archive proof 与独立仅 archive 验证。本地 "
"archive 保留和 durable hard-link 名称不建立异地存储、发布或 release。"

msgid ""
"The host observations retain their recorded source scopes in "
"`/workspace/nexus-build-maintenance-20261012/documentation/host-tool-"
"support-observations.json`. Current locked closure and final-source receipts"
" are indexed in the delivery result index. The ledger's configuration, "
"target, workflow, delivery and transport reports retain their raw "
"executions, failure attempts and source scopes. Physical HIL remains "
"`not_executed` throughout this build-system maintenance work."
msgstr ""
"Host 观察保持 `/workspace/nexus-build-maintenance-20261012/documentation/host-"
"tool-support-observations.json` 中记录 scope。当前 locked closure 与最终源码 receipt "
"索引在 delivery result index。台账的配置、目标、workflow、delivery、transport "
"报告保留原始执行、失败尝试和源码 scope。整个构建系统维护的物理 HIL 保持 `not_executed`。"


